  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "民主kap獨裁"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Bîn-chú kap To̍k-chhâi</span></h1><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：陳雷</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">（本文是漢羅合用kap全羅馬字一段一段對照）</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán講台灣是一个民主ê國家，因為台灣人ē-tàng決定啥人做總統，啥人做立委。Lán講中國是獨裁國家，因為中國人bē-tàng決定啥人做主席、做人民大會代表。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán kóng Tâi-oân sī 1 ê bîn-chú ê kok-ka, in-ūi Tâi-oân-lâng ē-tàng koat-tēng siáⁿ-lâng chò chóng-thóng, siáⁿ-lâng chò li̍p-úi. Lán kóng Tiong-kok sī to̍k-chhâi kok-ka, in-ūi Tiong-kok-lâng bē-tàng koat-tēng siáⁿ-lâng chò chú-se̍k, chò jîn-bîn tāi-hōe tāi-piáu.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣ê總統、立法委員tio̍h-ài考慮人民ê需要。做了無好，後擺換人做。中國ê主席kap小數特權為家己ê利益做代誌。因為啥人做主席、做代表m̄是人民決定--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tâi-oân ê chóng-thóng, li̍p-hoat úi-goân tio̍h-ài khó-lū jîn-bîn ê su-iàu. Chò liáu bô hó, āu-pái ōaⁿ lâng chò. Tiong-kok ê chú-se̍k kap sió-sò͘ te̍k-koân ūi ka-tī ê lī-ek chò tāi-chì. In-ūi siáⁿ-lâng chò chú-se̍k, chò tāi-piáu m̄ sī jîn-bîn koat-tēng--ê.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣人自由自在，想啥講啥，sì-kè來來去去，若無犯法，無人ē來掠，沒收伊ê財產。因為有chia-ê自由安全ê保障，台灣人ē beh保護chit个制度。Che就是民主ê實力。中國人無安全、無自由。政府hoah掠就掠，財產hoah沒收就沒收。獨裁者想空想縫控制人民，限制in想啥、講啥、做啥。Che就是獨裁國家ê本質。中國人ài beh自由，ài有安全，in反對chit款制度。Che 就是獨裁國家天生ê弱點。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tâi-oân-lâng chū-iû chū-chāi, siūⁿ siáⁿ kóng siáⁿ, sì-kè lâi-lâi-khì-khì, nā bô hoān-hoat, bô lâng ē lâi lia̍h, bu̍t-siu i ê châi-sán. In-ūi ū chia-ê chū-iû an-choân ê pó-chiòng, Tâi-oân-lâng ē beh pó-hō͘ chit ê chè-tō͘. Che tō sī bîn-chú ê si̍t-le̍k. Tiong-kok-lâng bô an-choân, bô chū-iû. Chèng-hú hoah lia̍h tō lia̍h, châi-sán hoah bu̍t-siu tō bu̍t-siu. To̍k-chhâi-chiá siūⁿ-khang-siūⁿ-phāng khòng-chè jîn-bîn, hān-chè in siūⁿ siáⁿ, kóng siáⁿ, chò siáⁿ. Che tō sī to̍k-chhâi kok-ka ê pún-chit. Tiong-kok-lâng ài beh chū-iû, ài ū an-choân, in hoán-tùi chit khoán chè-tō͘. Che tō sī to̍k-chhâi kok-ka thian-seng ê jio̍k-tiám.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">民主保證財產自由kap安全，自然行資本主義ê路。大家顧趁錢，鼓舞消費，造成資源浪費，環境汙染。Che是近代資本主義者，台灣在內，需要緊解決ê問題。中國雖然無民主，但是小數ê特權者利用國家ê資本，chiâⁿ做特權資本主義，仝款浪費資源，破壞環境。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Bîn-chú pó-chèng châi-sán chū-iû kap an-choân, chū-jiân kiâⁿ chu-pún chú-gī ê lō͘. Tāi-ke kò͘ thàn-chîⁿ, kó͘-bú siau-hùi, chō-sêng chu-goân lōng-hùi, khoân-kéng u-jiám. Che sī kīn-tāi chu-pún chú-gī-chiá, Tâi-oân chāi-lāi, su-iàu kín kái-koat ê būn-tê. Tiong-kok sui-jiân bô bîn-chú, tān-sī sió-sò͘ ê te̍k-koân-chiá lī-iōng kok-ka ê chu-pún, chiâⁿ-chò te̍k-koân chu-pún chú-gī, kāng-khoán lōng-hùi chu-goân, phò-hāi khoân-kéng.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī台灣，人人ē-sái追求伊ê理想，發展伊ê智慧、能力，chiâⁿ做集體發展ê動力。Che就是lán上大ê優點。中國壓制個人ê理想、智慧、能力，致使集體ê動力衰弱。長期講--來，che就是民主國家超過獨裁國家ê根本原因。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī Tâi-oân, lâng-lâng ē-sái tui-kiû i ê lí-sióng, hoat-tián i ê tì-hūi, lêng-le̍k, chiâⁿ-chò chi̍p-thé hoat-tián ê tōng-le̍k. Che tō sī lán siōng tōa ê iu-tiám. Tiong-kok ap-chè kò-jîn ê lí-sióng, tì-hūi, lêng-le̍k, tì-sú chi̍p-thé ê tōng-le̍k soe-jio̍k. Tn̂g-kî kóng--lâi, che tō sī bîn-chú kok-ka chhiau-kòe to̍k-chhâi kok-ka ê kin-pún goân-in.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣人比中國人khah自由安全，khah有機會追求伊個人ê理想、希望。長期講--來，民主ê台灣比獨裁ê中國khah有前途。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tâi-oân-lâng pí Tiong-kok-lâng khah chū-iû an-choân, khah ū ki-hōe tui-kiû i kò-jîn ê lí-sióng, hi-bāng. Tn̂g-kî kóng--lâi, bîn-chú ê Tâi-oân pí to̍k-chhâi ê Tiong-kok khah ū chiân-tô͘.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>#寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">專欄，</span><span><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字。</b></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報328期，2021年7月出刊。</b></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-family: inherit;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div></div>"
